 "notes": "Tier shelf. Kept all 8 old kinds; added Stair climber (StairMaster wiki) and Ski ergometer (Concept2 wiki, for the SkiErg). Trimmed TRUE (Apex/Gravity/Launch) and Marcy Pro SKU runs, NordicTrack treadmill list from 13 to 4 plus test winners (reviewed.com: Commercial 1750 best, Sole F63 value), dropped Aviron Fit Bike, Yesoul S3, Keiser M3i Studio Plus, NordicTrack X24 Bike. Added test winners from reviewed.com (treadmills, bikes, rowers), Fortune (ellipticals), Garage Gym Reviews (air bikes: Rogue Echo best) and Frontdeskreview (Assault vs Airdyne). Drive/resistance types moved into t. Technogym and Life Fitness ellipticals and manual curved treadmills (Woodway, AssaultRunner) not added: no fetched page named the models."
